{% block content %}
<main class="ind-page">

    <section class="ind-hero">
        <div class="ind-hero-inner">
            <p class="ind-hero-breadcrumb"><a href="{{ pageUrls.industries }}">Industries</a> / Insurance</p>
            <span class="ind-hero-framework">DORA</span>
            <h1 class="ind-hero-headline">Continuous validation for insurers under <span class="ind-hero-headline-emph">DORA</span></h1>
            <p class="ind-hero-sub">Insurance undertakings and groups carry binding obligations on ICT risk, incident reporting, and resilience. VORNAC delivers exploit-proven findings, audit-ready for DORA. Continuously. Not once a year.</p>
            <div class="ind-hero-actions">
                {% include "partials/hero-demo-button.njk" %}
                <a href="{{ pageUrls.pentesting }}" class="ind-btn-ghost">How it works</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ind-section ind-section--cream">
        <div class="ind-section-inner">
            <header class="ind-section-head">
                <h2 class="ind-section-title">What DORA requires from insurers</h2>
                <p class="ind-section-lead">The Digital Operational Resilience Act applies to insurance undertakings and groups. Supervisors expect demonstrable ICT risk management. Not policy documents alone.</p>
            </header>
            <div class="ind-req-grid">
                <article class="ind-req-card">
                    <h3 class="ind-req-card-title">ICT risk management</h3>
                    <p class="ind-req-card-desc">Documented frameworks, governance, and controls over ICT assets, including identification of critical functions and supporting systems.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="ind-req-card">
                    <h3 class="ind-req-card-title">Incident reporting</h3>
                    <p class="ind-req-card-desc">Major ICT-related incidents must be classified, reported, and root-caused. You need evidence that detection and response actually work.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="ind-req-card">
                    <h3 class="ind-req-card-title">Digital operational resilience testing</h3>
                    <p class="ind-req-card-desc">Threat-led penetration testing (TLPT) and resilience testing on critical ICT systems, with results that supervisors can verify.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="ind-req-card">
                    <h3 class="ind-req-card-title">Third-party ICT risk</h3>
                    <p class="ind-req-card-desc">Oversight of critical ICT service providers, contractual safeguards, and concentration risk, including validation of what providers expose in your perimeter.</p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ind-gap-band">
        <div class="ind-gap-inner">
            <div>
                <h2 class="ind-gap-title">One pentest a year. 364 days flying blind.</h2>
                <p class="ind-gap-text">Point-in-time assessments cannot prove resilience when your claims platforms, policy admin systems, and partner APIs change every sprint. Supervisors expect ongoing evidence. Not PDFs from last year.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="ind-gap-stat">
                <div class="ind-gap-stat-num">0</div>
                <p class="ind-gap-stat-label">False positives. Every finding exploit-proven, with reproducible PoC.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ind-section ind-section--dark">
        <div class="ind-section-inner">
            <header class="ind-section-head ind-section-head--light">
                <h2 class="ind-section-title">How VORNAC helps insurers</h2>
                <p class="ind-section-lead">Continuous adversarial validation with reports your risk, compliance, and audit teams can use without rewriting.</p>
            </header>
            <ul class="ind-help-list">
                <li class="ind-help-item">
                    <span class="ind-help-num">1</span>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="ind-help-title">Audit-ready for DORA</h3>
                        <p class="ind-help-desc">Findings documented to survive DORA audits. Ready for internal audit and supervisory dialogue.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="ind-help-item">
                    <span class="ind-help-num">2</span>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="ind-help-title">TLPT-ready evidence</h3>
                        <p class="ind-help-desc">Real attack chains across your live environment, not theoretical CVE lists. Proof-of-concept for every finding, cryptographically signed.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="ind-help-item">
                    <span class="ind-help-num">3</span>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="ind-help-title">Continuous, production-safe cadence</h3>
                        <p class="ind-help-desc">Validate on every release and on demand via API. Non-destructive in production, hosted in Germany under BDSG and GDPR.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ind-related">
        <div class="ind-related-inner">
            <p class="ind-related-title">Also relevant</p>
            <div class="ind-related-links">
                <a href="{{ pageUrls['industries-financial-services'] }}" class="ind-related-link">Financial services (DORA · VAIT)</a>
                <a href="{{ pageUrls['industries-enterprise'] }}" class="ind-related-link">Enterprise (NIS2)</a>
                <a href="{{ pageUrls.pentesting }}" class="ind-related-link">VORNAC Pentesting</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ind-cta">
        <div class="ind-cta-inner">
            <h2 class="ind-cta-headline">Prove resilience to your supervisor. <em>Continuously</em>.</h2>
            <p class="ind-cta-sub">30-minute session. We map your insurance ICT landscape to a continuous DORA-aligned validation cycle.</p>
            <div class="ind-cta-actions">
                {% include "partials/hero-demo-button.njk" %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

</main>
{% endblock %}
